  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Frankolimano?</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Boukephalos was an ancient port located south of Kenchreai on the Saronic coast of the Corinthia. Wiseman states that it likely corresponds to the modern harbor at Frankolimano on the Bay of Kenchreai.",
